  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bank Lviv - &amp;amp;amp;#128;15m Senior loan - 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A 3Y senior unsecured LCY-denominated loan of up to &#x20ac;15 million equivalent to  be provided to Bank Lviv to enable the bank&apos;s support to private micro-, small  and medium-sized enterprises (&quot;MSMEs&quot;) in Ukraine. The facility is under the  EBRD Financial Intermediaries Framework (&quot;FIF&quot;).  The Project will help Bank Lviv to maintain sustainable funding base during the  crisis and provide continued access to LCY finance for private MSMEs, including  businesses affected by the ongoing war on Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
